    "contentUrl": "https://content.jwplatform.com/videos/0fZyhfuf-K3AjnAEN.mp4",
    "description": "In this video, Nicole shows you how to make homemade chicken nuggets using both an air-fryer and an oven. This crispy chicken recipe starts by cutting a boneless skinless chicken breast into nugget-sized pieces. After coating the pieces with melted butter, dip the nuggets in a breadcrumb mixture that’s made with parmesan cheese, dried basil, thyme, and salt. Crisping the nuggets in the air-fryer cuts the cooking time in half compared to baking them in the oven, but both ways yield golden and crunchy nuggets. Whether you’re a kid or an adult, nothing beats this tender chicken dish!",
